 $2.064$ | $2.492$ | $2.797$ |\n| $25$ | $1.316$ | $1.708$ | $2.060$ | $2.485$ | $2.787$ |\n| $26$ | $1.315$ | $1.706$ | $2.056$ | $2.479$ | $2.779$ |\n\nFrom this row, we see that\n\n$$\nP(X\\ge 2.787)=0.005.\n$$\n\nTherefore, our answer is $x=2.787.$"} :step/id #uuid "5c114556-2f90-598a-a61e-2e9035fcc22d"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186514526 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186514465 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2a2356bf-311c-51bb-9c39-b10fe214fff2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "2.528" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513646} {:answer/id #uuid "527bfb4f-9d52-595b-b3f0-ce4b1acefcef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "1.323" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513760} {:answer/id #uuid "7b7993b3-f733-5e81-92fe-d298f6220041" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "1.328" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513856} {:answer/id #uuid "8cf90eb5-a13e-5686-9760-9e87d8d3d500" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "2.539" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513896} {:answer/id #uuid "f3b3bcfd-2937-5d70-b9ad-bb649cdc22c1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "2.861" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186514166}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186513856} :answer-field/id #uuid "2aecb7f6-bd05-5c5c-981f-c41f2b10cce7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186514241}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "d5be6574-3a28-52d0-8e4b-f267e2db636b" :question/math-academy-id "q-142541" :question/problem "The table below gives the values of $x$ that satisfy $P(X\\ge x)=p,$ where $X$ has a student's $t$-distribution ${T}_{k}$ with $k$ degrees of freedom. Given that the random variable $X∼{T}_{19},$ find the value of $x$ such that $P(X\\le x)=0.9.$\n\n| $k∖p$ | $0.100$ | $0.050$ | $0.025$ | $0.010$ | $0.005$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $19$ | $1.328$ | $1.729$ | $2.093$ | $2.539$ | $2.861$ |\n| $20$ | $1.325$ | $1.725$ | $2.086$ | $2.528$ | $2.845$ |\n| $21$ | $1.323$ | $1.721$ | $2.080$ | $2.518$ | $2.831$ |" :question/worked-solution "The table shows probabilities in the form $P(X\\ge x).$ So first, we express the desired probability in this form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(X\\ge x) & =1-P(X\\le x) \\\\  & =1-0.9 \\\\  & =0.1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since $X∼{T}_{19},$ we focus on the row of the table that corresponds to $k=19.$\n\n| $k∖p$ | $0.100$ | $0.050$ | $0.025$ | $0.010$ | $0.005$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $19$ | $1.328$ | $1.729$ | $2.093$ | $2.539$ | $2.861$ |\n| $20$ | $1.325$ | $1.725$ | $2.086$ | $2.528$ | $2.845$ |\n| $21$ | $1.323$ | $1.721$ | $2.080$ | $2.518$ | $2.831$ |\n\nFrom this row, we see that\n\n$$\nP(X\\ge 1.328)=0.100.\n$$\n\nTherefore, our answer is $x=1.328.$"} :step/id #uuid "b88b88a1-0ae2-5a32-886d-78f1dc75d173" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186514535}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186514535 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186514405 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "317af612-bd74-5d49-94a6-9a8a6e10174d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "1.325" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513663} {:answer/id #uuid "3e3a2f76-a9c8-57ad-af4f-54fc0e6cd390" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "2.518" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513697} {:answer/id #uuid "82d3ce4e-9325-578a-bfa5-1a9cb4acdcf7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "2.845" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513874} {:answer/id #uuid "a4a2c2e4-f556-523a-a75e-2e4591426514" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "1.328" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513955} {:answer/id #uuid "c000eb5b-de3d-5c48-8197-770d70f4bc71" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "2.528" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186514039}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186514039} :answer-field/id #uuid "fb69b1a1-571c-5439-bbf9-3a6f22a0ac17" :answe